## Executive Summary

FY 2025 marks MedSync's transition from high-growth startup to scale-stage company. Our plan targets $225M ARR (34% growth) while achieving operational efficiency and IPO readiness. Key initiatives include MedSync AI launch, enterprise acceleration, and infrastructure investment.

---

## FY 2025 Objectives

### Company OKRs

| Objective | Key Results |
|-----------|-------------|
| **O1: Accelerate Revenue** | $225M ARR (+34%), $57M new ARR |
| **O2: Launch MedSync AI** | GA by Q3, 50% customer adoption |
| **O3: IPO Readiness** | SOX compliance, board composition |
| **O4: Scale Operations** | 1,500 employees, 79% gross margin |
| **O5: Customer Excellence** | 125% NRR, +52 NPS |

